---
description: Bind report operations and effective period to the approved organizational boundary.
args: { dossier: ReportingDossier; change: ReportChange }
returns: ReportingBoundary
---
Identify the boundary concept that governs each operation from the report requirement and approved boundary evidence. Keep ownership, operational control and other supplied concepts separate. Require a current approval for a changed effective scope. Do not choose the interpretation that yields a lower total. If scope or period precedence is unclear, preserve the prior boundary and block aggregation.
